      "title": "Rubio, Jaishankar meet in Mumbai as U.S. and India aim to finalise trade deal",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/marco-rubio-mumbai-visit-october-20-2026/article71603994.ece",
      "description": "The two sides discussed energy security, defence cooperation and strengthening bilateral ties, Mr. Rubio said",
